{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Calculating Fractions 是一款專為分數計算而設計的應用程式，因應 fractioncalculators.com 訪客需求而開發。它適合學生、教師及任何需要處理分數計算的人，目前正限時免費，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n\n<h2>分數四則運算</h2>\n<p>此 App 支援分數的加、減、乘、除四則運算，並可處理真分數、假分數、帶分數及整數等不同類型。介面設計簡潔直觀，沒有多餘元素，操作快速流暢，用戶可以輕鬆輸入數字並即時得到結果。此 App 毋須連接互聯網，因此無論在學校、辦公室或戶外環境，都可以隨時進行分數計算，是實用性極高的數學工具。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-284-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-285-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-286-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-287-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2048x2732bb-26-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2048x2732bb-27-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Calculating Fractions</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T04:19:18.122839+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}